			"notes": "## What's Changed\n\n* Added custom trainer models with textures, animations and variants. Includes an Explorer example pack and 3D previews in the Battle Phone. By @matheo-1712 in [[#98](https://github.com/matheo-1712/cobblemon-trainers/pull/98)](https://github.com/matheo-1712/cobblemon-trainers/pull/98).\n* Rewards now support custom item data, such as names, lore and enchantments, using the same syntax as `/give`. This uses item components, which replaced item NBT tags in Minecraft 1.21.1. The Battle Phone preview also shows this data. By @matheo-1712 in [[#99](https://github.com/matheo-1712/cobblemon-trainers/pull/99)](https://github.com/matheo-1712/cobblemon-trainers/pull/99).\n* Reworked the BW battle intro layout and VS graphic. Names are centred below each character, with matching spacing and automatic resizing for long names. Added Ivor battle music and updated the web editor’s texture and sound lists. By @matheo-1712 in [[#101](https://github.com/matheo-1712/cobblemon-trainers/pull/101)](https://github.com/matheo-1712/cobblemon-trainers/pull/101).\n\n**Full Changelog**: [[v1.0.1...v1.1.0](https://github.com/matheo-1712/cobblemon-trainers/compare/v1.0.1...v1.1.0)](https://github.com/matheo-1712/cobblemon-trainers/compare/v1.0.1...v1.1.0)"
